    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31245" root="عيف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيَفَانٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيَّهَانٌ</span>, (O, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيِّفَانٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيِّهَانٌ</span>,
(so in the CK,) One <i>whose natural disposition,</i>
(O, K,) <i>and habit,</i> or <i>wont,</i> (K,) <i>it is to dislike,</i>
or <i>loathe, a thing.</i> (O, K.)

